Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.56,0:00:04.69,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}L4 殖民地 孟德爾
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.69,0:00:29.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.23,0:00:30.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.04,0:00:32.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以前你說過一旦Heaven's Base被攻陷的話
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.17,0:00:34.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下一個就是奧布了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.61,0:00:36.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.63,0:00:38.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被攻陷了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.89,0:00:40.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,比估計的還要快
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.62,0:00:47.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但為什麼下一個就是奧布呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.13,0:00:52.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,狄蘭達爾說過要對付的是Logos吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.90,0:00:54.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為奧布是強國
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.25,0:00:57.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,它的力量 理念都很強
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.41,0:01:04.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但那在狄蘭達爾議長的如意算盤面前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.81,0:01:07.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只不過是個障礙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.48,0:01:11.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他的如意算盤是什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.09,0:01:18.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還不完全清楚 但似乎逐漸露出原形了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.17,0:01:22.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長或許是想將地球和PLANT合而為一
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.63,0:01:26.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,創造世界新秩序
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.67,0:01:34.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說不定現在這些騷亂全部都是為此而打下的基礎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.73,0:03:29.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,格茲隊到東邊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.72,0:03:31.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,醫療班在哪裡 衛生兵
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.83,0:03:33.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,建築內的陷阱偵察已全部完畢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.99,0:03:34.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,確認安全
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.15,0:03:37.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好 開始搬送傷者
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.65,0:03:38.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還不能大意
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.20,0:03:42.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,吉普利爾不見了?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.85,0:03:44.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不見了? 怎麼會
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.28,0:03:48.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎是在基地投降之前就獨自偷偷逃走了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.21,0:03:53.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拋棄了其他所有的Logos成員
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.21,0:03:56.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 真令人困擾
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.73,0:03:59.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他還打算做什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.20,0:04:00.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.26,0:04:05.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總之不抓到他就沒有進展
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.26,0:04:07.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,巴拿馬還是維多利亞
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.02,0:04:10.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不知是否又逃到什麼是非之地去了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.22,0:04:14.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,果然沒那麼簡單就能結束啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.99,0:04:15.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒那種事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.67,0:04:19.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下次找到他 我一定把他踩扁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.56,0:04:28.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,麻煩優先處理這個
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.75,0:04:31.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了 那就這麼辦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.02,0:04:33.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思 拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.08,0:04:34.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪琉艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.21,0:04:37.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,修理方面如何了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.16,0:04:42.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被整得挺慘的 得花不少時間
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.66,0:04:45.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過大家都在努力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.60,0:04:47.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.43,0:04:51.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.65,0:04:56.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,累了嗎? 不…是有點心急吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.26,0:04:59.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不…沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.41,0:05:02.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關係的 大家都一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.90,0:05:06.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,特別是收到Heaven's Base的消息之後
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.34,0:05:10.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,或許是在害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.11,0:05:15.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,連阿斯蘭都受到如此待遇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.18,0:05:18.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總覺得 不明白的事情太多
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.17,0:05:21.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在的我又無能為力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.26,0:05:24.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣下去什麼都保護不了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.76,0:05:27.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲很快就會回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.36,0:05:29.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那時一定…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.00,0:05:33.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對吧 所以在那之前要振作
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.22,0:05:35.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.56,0:05:40.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,從陷落的Heaven's Base中逮捕了數名Logos成員
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.23,0:05:45.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在聯合與PLANT已共同開設國際法庭
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.48,0:05:46.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,醒了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.30,0:05:49.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.14,0:05:54.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 感覺死了比較輕鬆
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.30,0:05:59.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過很遺憾 似乎沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.03,0:06:02.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別說這種話了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.28,0:06:04.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,誰都不會開心的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.45,0:06:07.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.70,0:06:09.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,梅琳呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.24,0:06:13.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在稍微有點發燒 不過沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.58,0:06:16.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,米莉雅麗亞聽她說了些情況
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.03,0:06:19.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.73,0:06:22.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是Minerva上的管制員吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.97,0:06:25.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 她救了我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.88,0:06:29.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說與其被殺不如離開
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.64,0:06:33.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明明連話都沒說過幾句
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.33,0:06:37.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是被我捲進來的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.03,0:06:41.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,她一定是喜歡你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.03,0:06:46.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的 別擔心她
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.11,0:06:49.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我會好好照顧她的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.02,0:06:54.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還有 嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.51,0:06:59.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能原諒我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.38,0:07:05.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這話該由我來說吧 道歉的話
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.48,0:07:09.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在克列塔島基拉說的那些話 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.61,0:07:13.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我…曾打算結婚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.20,0:07:16.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卻什麼也沒和你說
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.84,0:07:25.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你想保護它吧 奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.31,0:07:31.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我太心急了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.93,0:07:36.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,厭惡一事無成的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.03,0:07:43.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉背負著國家的責任 日夜操勞
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.62,0:07:47.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而我卻什麼也做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.35,0:07:50.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,眼睜睜看著Junius 7…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.73,0:07:55.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我其實想做些什麼 想去阻止
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.21,0:07:57.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戰爭也是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.26,0:07:59.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.36,0:08:02.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.83,0:08:07.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 很難吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.49,0:08:09.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.78,0:08:12.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都想這樣做 也這樣說
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.89,0:08:15.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但卻無法如願
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.25,0:08:19.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,果然是Logos的錯嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.57,0:08:26.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的已經沒辦法了嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.17,0:08:32.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不會的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.49,0:08:35.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.55,0:08:42.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀 真是受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.92,0:08:47.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,殖民地裡的空氣也被放光了 一片荒蕪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.03,0:08:53.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,遺傳基因研究所卻不知為什麼 資料什麼的都被完全消除了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.55,0:08:55.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只有這個留下來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.47,0:08:59.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過這裡…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.28,0:09:03.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我想可能是當時的員工什麼的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.64,0:09:09.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,狄蘭達爾所提出的DESTINY PLAN
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.37,0:09:12.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,乍看對當前時代非常有利
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.43,0:09:17.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但我們不能忘記 人不是為了世界而生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.22,0:09:22.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而是人所生存之地 才稱其為世界
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.32,0:09:23.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.55,0:09:24.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,DESTINY PLAN?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.93,0:09:27.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.05,0:09:30.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,偵察型GINN?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.30,0:09:33.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被跟蹤了嗎? 達古斯塔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.26,0:09:36.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上去追 準備我的Gaia
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.32,0:09:39.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 請等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.71,0:09:41.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已經來不及了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.59,0:09:46.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,既然是跟蹤而來 母艦應該也不遠
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.43,0:09:51.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,或許孟德爾也被監視了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.77,0:09:54.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我大意了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.65,0:09:55.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 怎麼會
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.63,0:09:58.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 大意的是這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.07,0:10:01.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.45,0:10:05.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡工廠裡的機體 最終調整還沒完成
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.65,0:10:07.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,攻進來的話保不住
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.57,0:10:10.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓戰艦出發吧 巴爾特菲路特隊長
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.40,0:10:12.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在立刻
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.37,0:10:12.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.08,0:10:15.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可以 那樣更會被發現
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.28,0:10:17.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,反正都一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.84,0:10:20.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那就在他們攻進來之前出去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.02,0:10:22.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,盡量佔據有利形勢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.34,0:10:24.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但現在這艘船
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.94,0:10:27.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可是連幹掉一艘納斯卡級的戰力都沒有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.95,0:10:29.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼做都沒有勝算啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.05,0:10:33.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,並沒打算贏 而是要保護
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.99,0:10:39.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…和不遺餘力幫助我們的工廠人員們
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.52,0:10:41.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還有這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.49,0:10:46.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們出動的話 ZAFT就會追來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.35,0:10:50.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那樣可以爭取工廠應對的時間
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.89,0:10:53.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們最壞的情況 就是逃到降落軌道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.29,0:10:57.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,將那兩台和資料射向ArchAngel
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.13,0:11:01.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好 明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.90,0:11:04.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Eternal出擊準備
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.80,0:11:07.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,連接終端 我去告訴工廠
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.30,0:11:09.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,接通回路
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.58,0:11:18.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Eternal出發後工廠進入潛行模式
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.09,0:11:22.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能量傳輸正常 FCS啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.65,0:11:24.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,推進力上升 出擊臨界點
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.37,0:11:28.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,排除偽裝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.99,0:11:40.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Eternal出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.97,0:11:47.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉 馬上來艦橋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.37,0:11:51.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,有聯絡說Eternal出發了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.19,0:11:53.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說是被ZAFT發現
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.39,0:11:57.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.66,0:11:59.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Eternal
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.45,0:12:02.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,難道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.62,0:12:06.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好快
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.91,0:12:10.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過Eternal上到底都是些多胡來的人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.33,0:12:16.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到戰後趁混亂消聲匿跡的船讓我在這裡碰上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.36,0:12:18.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡諾本和霍爾斯特的位置呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.32,0:12:21.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是 現在位於Green 22 Charley
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.92,0:12:23.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Indigo 8 Alpha
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.77,0:12:24.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好 逼上去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.94,0:12:29.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別想逃 這些恐怖分子 總算找到他們了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.28,0:12:32.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Green Indigo 又有納斯卡級2
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.01,0:12:34.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Zaku GOUF 接近
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.82,0:12:36.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 甩掉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.64,0:12:37.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下舵15
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.48,0:12:42.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然不清楚被多少部隊追擊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.95,0:12:46.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但據說如果無法突破打算只用小艇與我們會合
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.60,0:12:48.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,小艇?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.70,0:12:52.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你幹什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.50,0:12:53.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果無法突破?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.19,0:12:54.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.21,0:13:01.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我旁邊這位剛才開始就鬧個不停
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.05,0:13:04.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說 讓基拉去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.45,0:13:06.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.87,0:13:10.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對要保護拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.29,0:13:15.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.85,0:13:19.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說是失去她就一切都完了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.53,0:13:22.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉 Rouge借我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.42,0:13:24.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還有推進器
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.51,0:13:25.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.21,0:13:26.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.80,0:13:28.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝 阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.58,0:13:34.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你記得艦橋的通信密碼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.26,0:13:40.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全員協助基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.95,0:13:42.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.97,0:13:45.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,福拉卡少校
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.95,0:13:47.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼連你都這麼叫我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.57,0:13:51.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫尼歐 羅阿諾克  是上校
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.35,0:14:04.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,導彈接近
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.63,0:14:07.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,迎擊 右舵10 下舵20
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.66,0:14:16.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別讓MS靠上 對空迎擊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.99,0:14:22.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,電壓和其他設置怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.83,0:14:24.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全設成和Strike一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.55,0:14:25.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.77,0:14:41.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪德克先生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.08,0:14:43.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全員撤離
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.75,0:14:53.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.43,0:14:55.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.61,0:14:56.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,隊長
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.70,0:14:59.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我去清理右側 讓距離能拉開
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.39,0:15:01.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聽好了 達古斯塔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.60,0:15:02.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別讓引擎被打
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.93,0:15:03.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.69,0:15:09.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Eternal的軌道預測沒問題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.15,0:15:11.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已經下降很多了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.94,0:15:13.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是 沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.81,0:15:15.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,路線清空 系統正常
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.15,0:15:18.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Strike推進器請出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.57,0:15:21.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,出發
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.62,0:16:00.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Gaia? 竟然還有那種東西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.64,0:16:02.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是什麼樣的組織
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.24,0:16:09.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,距離小艇的發射地點還有多遠
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.77,0:16:12.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還剩20 不 是25
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.60,0:16:15.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請努力堅持到那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.53,0:16:16.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.51,0:16:23.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.97,0:16:34.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲 要趕上
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.65,0:16:56.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.32,0:16:59.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Strike
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.58,0:17:17.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.28,0:17:21.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲 巴爾特菲路特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.66,0:17:23.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.72,0:17:24.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.87,0:17:27.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 但是我擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.53,0:17:55.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,傻瓜 那就快進Eternal
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.39,0:17:57.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,去拿你的機體
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.56,0:18:00.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.13,0:18:07.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,緊急著艦系統準備
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.37,0:18:19.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.60,0:18:23.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.65,0:18:33.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.53,0:18:34.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.70,0:18:37.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.40,0:18:39.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.72,0:18:42.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,看到你平安
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.22,0:18:45.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很高興
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.37,0:18:48.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是 基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.93,0:18:53.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.49,0:18:57.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.73,0:19:01.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,隊長
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.03,0:19:06.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲 趕快
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.39,0:19:07.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.21,0:19:29.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.25,0:19:34.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣我又能好好地戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.58,0:19:36.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我的戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.21,0:19:37.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.22,0:19:41.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,等著我 馬上就回來
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.07,0:19:45.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,然後回去吧 回大家那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.62,0:19:48.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.55,0:19:57.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,CPC設定完成 神經連接濃度正常 數據參數更新
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.26,0:19:59.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,原子爐臨界 能量傳輸正常 全系統正常
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.59,0:20:01.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Strike Freedom系統啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.39,0:20:09.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,X-20A Strike Freedom請出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.72,0:20:13.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉 大和  Freedom出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.06,0:20:37.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那機體是什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.69,0:20:39.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,新型機嗎? 好快啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.26,0:20:42.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Freedom?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.00,0:21:00.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.20,0:21:19.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,2分鐘?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.87,0:21:21.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,2分鐘內就打下25架Zaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.80,0:21:24.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,GOUF全滅?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.71,0:21:27.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,敵人MS接近
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.29,0:21:31.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全炮門打開 擊落它
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.60,0:21:43.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,給我打
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.18,0:21:52.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,推進器嚴重損壞 無法航行
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.68,0:21:54.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,霍爾斯特 卡諾本同樣無法航行
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.35,0:21:57.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.03,0:22:03.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Eternal 我們返航囉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.92,0:22:04.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.05,0:23:25.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,該攻擊是吉普利爾
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.93,0:23:28.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,並沒有錯誤
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.56,0:23:40.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,終於擋在卡嘉莉面前
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.73,0:23:41.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真會…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.59,0:23:45.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下集 機動戰士高達SEED Destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.02,0:23:47.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,黃金的意志
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.00,0:23:50.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在希望的光芒中閃耀 Akatsuki
